{% comment %}
NOTIFICATION: Gift card created (Settings > Notifications > Customer notifications > Gift card created)
Goes to whoever gets the Gift Evil card (the recipient, or the buyer if no recipient was set).
SUBJECT: {% if gift_card.recipient %}You got {{ gift_card.initial_value | money_without_trailing_zeros }} of evil{% else %}Your Gift Evil card is here{% endif %}
Brand: Heavy Metal Pro Stock: “The Evil One”. Built from boceto-v29/correos.html + hm.css. Table layout, inline CSS, 600px.
{% endcomment %}
